Fake products?
In short, it was a tragedy.
When using the second patch, I chose one with a fine pore texture. However, as soon as I opened it, I smelled a strange odor. I thought it was normal since I hadn’t used this product before. But when I tried to apply it to my face, I couldn’t tolerate it at all—the smell was so intense that I couldn’t describe it. It was so pungent that it made me cough immediately, and my eyes started to hurt and water. I quickly removed the patch and washed my face.
Not believing in the claims, I bought another identical product. This one doesn’t have such a strong smell, and I’m currently using it as a mask.
It reminds me of the smell of low-quality hair straightening products used in hair salons.
It’s really hard to imagine that skincare products sold directly by Amazon will also have to be avoided from now on…
Experience level slightly above average.
It’s almost like the top-of-the-line electric toothbrushes; there are many different cleaning modes available. However, few people actually change to a different mode every day when using their toothbrushes, right?
I’ve used it for half a year with no problems; I brush my teeth with it every day, and I only need to rinse it out about once every week or so.
Brush head accessories are just as cheap when bought on Amazon.
The app is a bit difficult to use. Apart from the issues related to color customization, do the other compatibility problems seem to be due to the fact that it’s an overseas version?
Hope to learn about the great Dharma.
Garbage after-sales service
The piano I bought one and a half months ago is missing a part. After notifying Amazon, I was given a phone number for after-sales support. Despite several attempts to communicate with them, I still haven’t received the part yet. What kind of efficiency is this?!
I guess that if there are problems after the purchase and they need to be repaired, it will be even more troublesome. I suggest that friends who value good after-sales service should just look for other options; it’s really too much of a hassle!
The merchant considered the customer’s needs before shipping the product :)
The seller is very responsible and specifically calls to ask about the screen size of the camera they use, truly considering their customers' needs.
Delivery speed is also fast.
The Diamond Film sticker also fits well and works effectively.
The problem with cheap goods is quite troublesome!
The order placed on the 18th was delivered only on the 25th – what a slow progress, like a snail’s pace, from Guangzhou to Beijing!
I bought a Z-value product, the label said it had scratches, but when I received the product I found 4 screws and bolts missing!
The child didn’t want to return the product, thinking it wasn’t a big problem. However, when it came to the small parts (the accessories), the child’s grandfather went to several nearby hardware stores and couldn’t find them anywhere!
Finally, Grandpa stuck it on!
It seems that we won’t be able to buy affordable products from Z in the future!
So I became a die-hard Amazon fan.
I bought it at an extremely discounted price, but unfortunately the child didn’t like the point-and-read pen.
It was already opened, but I tried to apply for a return. Surprisingly, they even came to pick up the item for free.
That’s absolutely awesome.
Return shipments are not encouraged, but this is the only service of its kind in China.
I hope it won’t be misused.
From now on, all my books will be bought here.
Overall, it’s okay; I don’t know whether it’s made of genuine leather or not.
The overall quality feels okay; I don’t know whether it’s made of genuine leather, so I can’t give a subjective opinion based on that alone.
It can hold A4-size documents up to 80 pages thick (but not too hard or rigid), but it may not fit large, heavy objects that cannot be deformed.
The bag is soft and has very user-friendly internal dividers. It's pretty good.
It’s just that the one I got has a small sand hole on the bottom. I don’t know if it’s because of my bad luck or what…
I'm too lazy to go back and forth swapping, so I'll just tolerate it.
I give it a four-star rating overall; it’s still worth it.
More suitable for young people
99 products were sold out in just 1 second.
The quality of construction, color, and feel of the woolen pants are all good; they are soft and have a moderate thickness, and there is no kerosene-like smell.
Unfortunately, the design is more slim-fit and better suited for younger people.
3XL, flat waist 2 feet 5 inches, maximum stretch size 4 feet, 1.79/80 kg with a slightly tight waist.
It seems there’s no elastic band around the waist, so it’s quite difficult to make the waistband a bit looser.
Also, it’s uncomfortable to wear close to the skin.
I strongly recommend that Amazon discontinue the use of EMS!
Product: 5 stars; Logistics: 1 star; Average rating: 3 stars.
I don’t understand why Amazon would use EMS for shipping; it’s widely recognized in the industry as an unreliable method. After all, a computer is a valuable item!
After making the purchase, the order showed that delivery was expected on the 20th. So, our family members waited at home for three days!
Why does it take four to five days to send something from Xiamen to Fuzhou?
This morning on the 22nd, I checked the logistics tracking and finally saw that the package had arrived in Fuzhou. I was ready to happily receive it, but in the evening—without receiving any phone calls or texts—I checked the tracking again and found that the package had already been signed for at noon, and it even showed that I had signed for it myself!
I was stunned!
Who am I? Where am I? Did I really buy this computer?
I’m just starting to doubt the whole meaning of life, you know?
I had to make one last trip to a collection point before I could get the computer back.
The specific reason, in simple terms, is that the delivery driver mixed up the two order numbers. Fortunately, the items weren’t lost, so that’s the main thing.
I strongly recommend that Amazon stop using EMS; I will definitely not buy their packages if they use EMS again in the future.
Waiting for a response from the supplier.
The packaging had no markings at all. I directly called the supplier and was told that the absence of markings indicated that the product was genuine. If I had any doubts, I could send the product (including any spare parts) to Johnson & Johnson for inspection by mail. I also provided my vehicle license plate number and phone number, and they promised to send me a text message to inform me that they had entered my information into Johnson & Johnson’s official warranty database. However, I still haven’t received that text message to this day…
Japan's Amazon has severely harmed buyers' interests due to a customer service issue (the 8c caterpillar shipped as an 8cm caterpillar) (8c = 14cm; 8cm = 2c).
Admitting the mistake, but constantly shirking responsibility by emphasizing that the goods belong to a third party and that one cannot impose any obligations on that third party.
Order number: 503-4265464-1830254.
I originally bought the page size options of 7c, 8,9c, and thought it was a trap, called the Chinese-Japanese customer service and told them 8c is 8c, but I waited until the product came back to China to find that it was only 8cm, I think it was a completely deliberate trap to trap the Chinese (according to Amazon after sales), now look at the page no longer has this option.
Chinese Customer Service: We apologize for the inconvenience caused to you. We have two options for you:
1. If you return the product, the buyer is responsible for all shipping costs.
2. If you don’t return the product, we will compensate you with 1000 yen.
(I do the math: the shoes cost over 4,000 yen, which is about 200 RMB. If I choose option 1, I won’t get the shoes and will lose 200 RMB.)
Choose option 2; I had shoes and was compensated with 2,000 yen, resulting in a loss of 1,500 RMB. The customer service replied that they would record it, handle it seriously, and send an email back the next day stating that I did not accept the mediation from the Chinese customer service, which ended up this way.
I mentioned that on the purchase page, there were confusing options like 7c, 8c, 9c. The Chinese customer service staff helped me by explaining that the Japanese standard codes don’t use the letter “c”; instead, they use numbers like 140. But have you even checked the other related pages (like the “caterpillar”-related ones)?
Both US and Japanese size labels are sometimes used interchangeably.
And again, why did you put 8cm between 7c and 9c, and what does the smallest size mean?
Chinese customer service: We provide services in Chinese, but since we don’t know that you are shipping the item back to your home country, we will not cover the shipping costs for you.
I don’t understand this logic anymore. I’m Japanese, and I still need Chinese-language customer support. Chinese people living in Japan don’t need Chinese-language customer support either. Tourists who come to Japan don’t have the time to make international long-distance calls. So the question is: Who exactly needs to make Chinese-language calls to Amazon’s overseas shopping services? It’s probably people like me who shop on Japanese online platforms.
Isn’t the Chinese customer service on Amazon just there to make it easier for us people who shop overseas?
The packaging is damaged; we need to wait for some time to assess the quality of the product.
The outer packaging is severely damaged; the inner box seems to be new, but the instruction manual does not appear to be new. The house was renovated in September, and we are stocking up on products. I hope they will not be damaged by the time they are delivered. Please explain to Amazon why several customers have mentioned the packaging damage, yet you seem to be unbothered by this issue. Thank you!
The products are good, but the platform’s bureaucracy remains the same.
Hard drives have excellent quality and great value for money; they're even cheaper than buying in Hong Kong. I highly recommend purchasing them if you don't need to use them urgently or can tolerate shipping delays.
But one must say that Amazon’s bureaucracy is still there, unchanged from when I swore to never use it, and you can’t even find out what your actual shipping status is; information always arrives several weeks later, and you can never complain about anything. It’s just as bureaucratic!
It’s been a few days since the goods were received, but the logistics information still states that you will receive them in another 10 or so days!
Excited beyond expectations
I was really unsure before making the purchase, but as soon as I opened the package, I felt that everything looked very authentic and trustworthy!
Finally, when I touched the headphone cord, it felt very elastic and of high quality; I couldn't wait to plug it in my phone and open QQ Music.
I was stunned; the sound quality is 3D surround!
I asked at a physical communications store, and the price is around 30 yuan. However, it’s definitely not a Pisen brand product; it’s a generic brand. So even though this Pisen product costs 27 yuan, the cost-performance ratio is absolutely worth it!
The logistics are too slow.
It was supposed to be delivered by October 16th, but I received it only on the 21st. What a poor service!
The delivery service is terrible; buying things from Amazon is already slow enough, but I didn’t expect it to be this slow!
The wrong image/illustration has been used.
I thought I would receive headphones similar to the ones shown in Figure 1, but instead I got the ones shown in Figure 2. Apart from the mismatch in the appearance of the products, what does it mean that the volume levels of the sound on the left and right sides of the headphones are different?
Although the names are the same, I still hope everyone will be careful. Additionally, I would like to ask the person in charge at Amazon to replace the images with the correct ones as soon as possible. Thank you very much.
Sleeves that are simply impossible to understand…
It’s claimed to be made of cowhide, and indeed it’s quite hard. However, upon closer inspection, there are many tiny cracks in certain areas; it’s unclear whether this is due to the material being genuine leather or not. Additionally, the sleeves of this garment are absolutely baffling. Normally, the sleeves of a jacket are longer than the hem of the jacket itself—by about 1-2 centimeters at most. But in this case, the sleeves are 5 centimeters longer than the hem. When the arms hang down naturally, they should reach the area between the palms and the fingertips; yet, with these sleeves, they actually cover the fingers as well.
It’s the hyphen!
Amazon pictures are in italics, and the results sent to me are in italics, isn't that cheating?
Worst online shopping experience
The system showed that the order was shipped on September 28th, but the customer still did not receive the goods until October 12th.
Query Amazon order status; seller did not provide shipping label, so cannot find where the order is.
So I sent an email to the seller asking if they could provide a delivery number, but there was no reply after two days.
Out of options, I contacted Amazon customer service, who provided me with the seller’s phone number. I then called the seller several times, and finally the call went through. I was informed that the package had been lost and that they could send me a new one immediately.
Although I was really angry, due to the urgent need for the computer, I didn’t say much to the seller. I just wanted it to be sent to me as soon as possible.
As a result, the next day I called to ask if the product had been shipped yet.
The seller says not yet; it will be delivered later in the afternoon.
I called again this afternoon, and the seller said they would definitely send the item, with shipping expected after 5 or 6 pm. However, when I called again at 7 pm, no one answered the phone.
I called again the next morning and asked if the package had been sent out.
Could you please tell me the order number?
The seller said that the item hadn’t been sent yet and told me that if I was in a hurry, I should place an order with another supplier; if I could wait, it would be sent in the afternoon.
There’s no other way; I’d have to place an order with another company, and then wait a long time again.
The only thing you can do is ask the seller to send the goods quickly.
Finally, after countless phone calls and follow-ups, I received the computer on October 16th.
As for the quality of the computer, I don’t know because it was bought for someone else; I’ll add my comments later on.
Fake products… and the fake ones are especially impressive (in a negative way).
I'm also addicted to Amazon selling fake products.
Customer service says I can't return because I used it; how do I know it's fake if I didn't use it?
Because of the trust, I feel disappointed; after all, it’s a product used for applying makeup to the face. It’s really better to buy it from a physical store and be willing to pay a higher price.
Since it was a flash sale, I didn’t read the reviews. I have already submitted a report to the State Administration for Industry and Commerce regarding the e-commerce platform involved. Let’s stand together for our rights.
A frustrating experience
The filter cartridges I bought online from another store before worked well in terms of filtration performance. Even after the 28-day period had passed, using them for one or two more days didn’t result in any water scale buildup.
Since the quality of the products I’ve bought from Amazon has always been satisfactory, I decided to make a purchase there this time. It was my first time buying a water filter from Amazon. However, the experience wasn’t good at all: scale started forming on the filter quite early on, and even after using it for 28 days, there were still small, black carbon particles floating in the water. I really don’t know whether I should continue using it or just throw it away… I’m very frustrated!
It’s really a good deal after the discount is applied; it’s sad though when Amazon offers fake discounts.
Purchased one week after the baby was born; it provides excellent heat retention.
Not a single trace of heat can be felt from the outside of the pot; this means it can effectively protect the temperature from being lost, even in cases where there is no risk of scalding people.
The air conditioner room is still very warm after one night.
Amazon says its anniversary sale is $320 off, but later found that everyone was getting $24.9, $289, and $2,999 discounts. It feels like being cheated, but when I compared prices at the supermarket, it was still cheaper than all those generic brands for the same price. From now on, I can take my car with me wherever I go.
This purchase was not satisfactory
This is the second time I’ve purchased Pampers diapers from Amazon. I had bought a box of them when the baby was 2 months old, choosing the diapers with paper imported from Europe. I was quite satisfied with the first purchase experience; the baby used just one diaper throughout the night, and it indeed lasted for 12 hours without the need to change it.
But this time, I bought size L diapers. Each box contained 2 individually packaged packs. When I opened them, I noticed that the paper used was quite loose compared to the imported Pampers. After using them on my baby, they seemed fine: there were no leaks, and no signs of rashes or other issues.
But by the time we used the second pack of diapers, red rashes appeared on the inner sides of the baby’s thighs immediately after using them, and they haven’t gone away yet.
I suspect that there’s a difference in the quality of the 2 packs inside 1 box.
I don’t think I’ll continue making purchases in the future!
It may be counterfeit; please have Amazon conduct a strict review.
Quality is terrible, packaging is loose and flimsy, lacking weight, even worse than street vendor products; it does not have a gram count or barcode, ten bags of which are also loose and flimsy, completely not meeting the characteristics of qualified products; this is Amazon's worst shopping experience, has already applied for return; fully belongs to quality issues; suggest merchants keep their eyes open, refuse inferior goods; additional information: I bought Xiangyi again, supermarket 23 yuan per 10 rolls, added several photos for comparison, further verified that the product is counterfeit, in order to provide consumers with clearer reference so as to avoid economic losses and further emotional distress!
Again, we hope that Amazon will be scrupulous in its sourcing of goods.
The labels have too poor adhesion; they are not waterproof.
Although the Bluetooth connection is very convenient, the printed content is not water-resistant, and the surface does not have any protective coating. Additionally, the adhesive on the labels is of very poor quality; they are completely unsuitable for use as cable labels, as they fall off easily. Friends who bought these labels to organize their cables should be aware of this.
The machine is new; buying it from overseas is a great option.
I took a look at the products during Christmas; the ones I bought before were more expensive by 150 yuan. However, the delivery times are a bit slower now.
The machines are still in pretty good condition; they’re all quite new.
The inbuilt Pikachu.
And if you connect it to the Pokémon Ball, you’ll get a Dreamy Pokémon as a reward.
The gameplay is good, and the portability is better than the PS4.
I already bought The Legend of Zelda and am just waiting for the game to release. I’ll try it again then.
Value for money is very high.
I've used it 3-4 times already.
1. The packaging is in good condition.
2. It is very simple to use and easy to clean.
3. You can definitely do your own haircuts at home, which saves money.
In summary, it was a very successful purchase.
The quality of the toy is good, but I have to complain about the packaging.
I received the package yesterday; it was bought from Amazon and was labeled as being shipped via EMS. However, in the end, it was delivered by Tmall’s courier service. How many different delivery routes were involved in this process? Do Amazon and Tmall have a good relationship with each other?
Let’s talk about the packaging again: The toy was wrapped in several layers of plastic wrap, and there wasn’t even any protective plastic bubble wrap inside. When I opened it, all the parts were simply placed in an empty box. Fortunately, the quality of the toy itself was good; no parts were damaged. However, the toy is much smaller than I expected. Since it doesn’t come with batteries, it tends to derail frequently when being pushed around by hand. I also feel that the gaps on both sides of the track are too large, indicating that the design is not well thought out.
The goods are quite good.
First of all, I want to mention that I just bought the computer a few days ago and immediately noticed a price reduction. The review I wanted to write was negative – although the computer itself was fairly good and offered great value for money. The CPU and GPU are sufficient for playing mainstream online games as well as a considerable number of large-scale single-player games. The cooling system is also very effective. However, the screen has some light leakage (a common issue with IPS screens), and the sound quality is not very good. The hard drive is also not up to par (it’s recommended to spend extra money on a solid-state drive). Yesterday, I took the computer to the after-sales service for a hardware check, and no issues were found. The pre-installed Windows 8.1 is not very user-friendly; it’s recommended to upgrade to Windows 10. The seller shipped the product quickly and responded promptly to all my inquiries. The invoice arrived the very day after I received the computer, which is quite nice. Unfortunately, there were no gifts included in the package.
(By the way, when buying keyboard stickers, definitely don’t buy from a store on Taobao called Eku Digital Center. The delivery is slow, the quality is poor, and if there are problems with the products, they won’t be refunded or replaced. The owner also uses a lot of foul language. I’m just exposing this shop specifically.)
Scoundrel!
When I made the purchase, the promotional page stated that a copy of the “The Three-Body Problem” series would be given for free upon spending 99 yuan. However, when the product arrived, the bonus was not included. I called customer service and was asked to provide a screenshot of the promotional page from that time. The question is: who buys something and also saves a screenshot of the web page? It’s your own promotional campaign—you should already have all the necessary evidence. All buyers should be more cautious in the future and make sure to save proof of their purchases.
I advise everyone not to waste their money needlessly.
I first purchased this product with great expectations, thinking that the Lele brand shouldn’t be that bad. Upon receiving it, the packaging looked decent, and the size was also acceptable. However, almost all the fruits in one box were soft; this couldn’t be detected just by looking at them – you had to feel them with your hands. When I tasted them, there was absolutely no flavor at all; they were bland and tasteless. Upon biting into them, the flesh inside was a dark yellow color, indicating that the fruits were spoiled. The box contained both good and bad fruits, and less than one-third of the contents were actually edible. I advise everyone not to buy this product – it’s not only expensive but also of extremely poor quality!
From this experience, I’ve learned my lesson: I will never buy fruits online again!
The quality of the images is unacceptable.
As a title for an ancient map collection, the book is unacceptable in its selection, type and printing of images, some of which are even mosaic-like, blurry and unrecognizable.
Even if this book is not a professional atlas, and even if the illustrations are of small size, they should still be in line with the extensive range of medieval documents left by our ancestors as listed in the table of contents!
(Moreover, many of the images can be obtained in high-quality original form from relevant industry resources.) What's the difference between using such images to compile a book and not using any images at all?
I am sorry for this kind of academic spirit.
I will not comment on the quality of the text; experts in the field have their own ways of assessing it.
Overall rating: 2 stars.
Good shopping
The product has received positive reviews!
I still have a relatively high level of trust in products sold directly by Amazon. Buying from overseas has become very convenient nowadays; the shipping time from abroad is just a few days longer than that from domestic sources. It’s worth mentioning that Amazon’s ability to handle customs clearance for imported goods is quite impressive, much faster than using third-party shipping services. As a result, I now purchase many of my items through Amazon’s international shopping options.
I hope the quality and price of domestic products can be better. Many things are made in China, but it’s actually cheaper to buy them abroad than to buy them locally. I hope they can make some improvements.
I bought something that had already been opened by someone else.
It’s indeed quite high to have to pay over a hundred in taxes for more than 300 machines. Now that it’s down to just over 600 machines, I feel much more satisfied.
When I received it, the seal tape looked suspiciously damaged, as if the package had been opened. I quickly took a photo, and sure enough, the package tore open easily upon being opened. The cardboard inside was also damaged. I was worried that someone else had returned the product, and since the anniversary date hadn’t even arrived yet, I decided to try using it with my husband right away. Unfortunately, the machine didn’t have any power at all. Fortunately, there were no food particles stuck in the blade; otherwise, who would want to go through the hassle of returning such a product from such a distance?
It’s still unknown whether it will work well or if there will be any problems in the short term. As mentioned in previous reviews, the products sent out when the item is out of stock are definitely not reliable!
Overall satisfaction
Previously I was worried about the camera's packaging; this time it turned out to be better. There is an airbag inside, and the three codes of the camera match up, so you can register on the official website. The shutter count is zero, but everything else will have to wait for time to test.
The delivery speed was quite fast. I’d like to complain about the courier: the valuable items were just left at the entrance, and the courier left immediately. I couldn’t open the packages and check their contents in front of him, which really frustrates me.
Too small; no umbrella cover; average material.
It's not a big number at all!
The second Tote umbrella: 1. It doesn’t come with a rain cover. 2. The material of the umbrella handle is of average quality. 3. Although it’s labeled as “Large”, it’s actually just a small, portable umbrella designed for one person to use; it might barely be enough for two people.
On the contrary, the one I bought from Amazon earlier can be used by three people without any problems at all.
The products are okay, but the after-sales service on Amazon is really much worse than on other websites.
After placing the order, I realized I had made a mistake. However, I was unable to cancel the order. When I tried to contact the online customer service via the website, I kept getting directed to broken links, and I couldn’t get in touch with them.
After the item arrived, the delivery driver called me and I said I didn’t want it anymore. I tried to cancel the order, but it wasn’t successful, so the driver took the item back and said I should first sign for it and then apply for a return.
The only thing that is said when you request a refund is that the food category cannot be returned once the order is received, and there is no way to call Amazon customer service, which is the same as saying that the order cannot be returned.
I have previously bought items on JD.com and Suning that were not eligible for return due to company policies, including milk and diapers. I contacted customer service, and the products were still refunded. Even for the diapers from JD.com, which had a strong odor after being opened, the refund was granted upon contacting customer service. However, this doesn’t work the same way on Amazon.
The rules are fixed, but people are living; I contacted your customer service to ask how this situation will be handled.
Tell me to either keep it for myself or let the delivery person buy it themselves. The delivery person already has a tough job; why should I make them pay for something that wasn’t purchased by me?
Okay, I won’t be returning it either; I’ll keep it for myself. However, I must give your service a score of 1.
The headphones are too loud and there is noise.
These headphones are absolutely terrible. I don’t know if there’s something wrong with my ears, or if the headphones just aren’t as good as they used to be.
I bought a blue one from that store two years ago; the sound quality was quite good, with no noise or issues with the bass. It lasted for over two years before it broke down, so I plan to buy another one (the Urban Beats model) since I still think it’s a decent option.
I saw another purple one that looked really nice, so I bought it. But when I opened it today and listened to it, something seemed off: one side of the device produced a loud sound, while the other side produced a low sound.
At first, I thought it was just due to the sound effects of that particular song and didn’t give it much thought. But after listening to them for a while, I realized that the problem was quite serious. Not only was there a noticeable pitch distortion, but the bass performance also wasn’t as good as it used to be. There was also some background noise. Is this phenomenon only present in the purple version I bought, or has the quality of headphone manufacturing really declined nowadays?
Quite poor reviews; I’m very disappointed.
The return must be made by noon tomorrow.
PS: It looks quite good too.
Products like this should not appear on Amazon's own platform (Amazon Direct).
I bought the product when it was on sale at a reasonable price, and considering the reviews, it’s indeed a very good product.
When I actually received the product, I was stunned: the surface of the item had extensive wear and tear, and there were signs of wear in many other areas as well. It’s either a defective product or an old one; I’ll upload pictures later.
I applied for a return, and the person from the manufacturer said that the issue was caused by transportation after seeing the pictures. Isn’t that just nonsense?
How could the interior of the product get worn out in any way?
There are only two possibilities: either it’s a defective or used product, or I deliberately damaged the item and then returned it for a refund.
Objectively, I have no proof that I did not damage the product, but based on my credit history of shopping on Amazon, I think that such an item should not be in Amazon's self-service, the customer chooses Amazon is trust, customer win, we win, the customer's victory is the manufacturer's victory, hope you all work together to improve, thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It’s definitely a genuine product; I’ve checked it at the official store. The watch has a beautiful appearance, exquisite craftsmanship, and is made with high-quality materials. Additionally, it features an imported mechanical movement, which gives it significant weight and quality that can’t be matched by those so-called “mechanical watches” that cost only three or four hundred yuan. This one is truly authentic and of superior quality.
The watch is accurate and within acceptable error limits; it comes with a jewelry appraisal certificate inside the box, and the 12-word mark on the dial is genuine diamond. It fits well for personal use, and as a gift, it adds to one's prestige.
The Bentley watches are indeed quite nice.
The stuff’s not bad.
The product is really good; I bought it as a gift for my girlfriend. However, I had some trouble at noon when the Canadian courier service was unavailable. The logistics company simply left the package in the “Mail Storage” service without sending me a verification message regarding the pick-up, which forced me to make two trips.
But the baby is really nice indeed.
Authentic! Packaging is perfect.
The packaging is complete, with an inflatable bag inside, and there are no online reviews, only a glowing look of a product.
There is also a layer of plastic wrap on the outer packaging of the bottle, just as described in the picture. The delivery was very fast too; it arrived the very next day after I took the photo.
It’s the genuine product; it’s just out of stock, and we don’t know when it will be available again.
It looks wonderful.
I had long been eyeing this camera, but for reasons other than price, I didn't buy it before. This time, because of the package discount, the price was still acceptable, so I bought it.
After making the purchase, there were no issues with anything else. However, when trying to connect the device via software, it simply wouldn’t connect. I use a TP router at home. After searching online, I found that many people were experiencing the same problem. I spent over two hours trying various methods to adjust the router’s settings. Finally, I managed to get it connected by using 360WIFI as a intermediary. During that time, I also called Xiaomi’s customer service, but they didn’t have any solutions to this issue and suggested that I contact Amazon for after-sales support.
Another point worth noting is that I saw comments from users online stating that the minimum size of the memory card supported by this camera is 8GB; any memory card with a smaller capacity will not be recognized. I hope everyone takes this into consideration.
It seems to work okay; the graphics are acceptable, but the sound quality is very poor. The device also generates a certain amount of heat, and if it’s left on all the time, the level of heat becomes quite uncomfortable.
In summary, there are many shortcomings in this product, so please be careful when buying it.
Lightweight and large capacity
I like its lightweight design and the large opening. However, the two separate compartments seem a bit unnecessary to me; I don’t really know what to put in them.
After making the purchase, I realized that on Amazon (for overseas purchases), there was another similar product from a different brand for just under two hundred yuan.
Amazon shipping problems
Upon receiving the goods and conducting an inspection, it was found that:
1. The packaging is severely worn out.
2. The instruction manual for the table has severe signs of wear and tear from use (i.e., it’s folded or creased due to frequent handling).
3. The clock does not move; the lamp cannot be charged and used, nor can it adjust time.
4. Contact Amazon customer service separately; you will have to pay the shipping costs to send the item to the United States out of your own pocket, and then the additional shipping fees will be reimbursed later.
The reason for the scores of 5 and 2 is that the customer service is quite good.
The first time I bought it, there was a problem with the product: all the lights were flickering and couldn’t be used.
I requested a replacement, but even three days after the item arrived in Shanghai, it still hasn’t been delivered to me.
The phone calls to the delivery staff are not answered.
The courier company said that they only have that contact information.
Amazon cannot find a place to lodge a complaint.
No request was made; however, in the case of a delayed delivery, they inexplicably delayed the delivery according to my request – and then this kind of message was sent to me.
Then they talked about some transfer issues again.
Anyway, it was a really poor shopping experience, which has made me start to doubt the effectiveness of Amazon’s logistics system as well as its control systems.
I don’t think I’ll be able to get it today either.
